{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生の中川智尋です (=･ ･=)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobRQe4eI.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mob58VfPT.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ツアー千葉公演ありがとうございました🍐"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "千葉ではふなっしーの飼い猫、ふにゃっしーとはじめましてしたよ~ かわいいね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ふなっしーには家族が多いみたい\nlonesomeではなさそう🧚‍♂️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ライブを終えておうちに帰ってから、\nふなっしーの動画をたくさん見て元気をもらいました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつか直接会いたいなあ…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "次は仙台公演！\nずんだ笹かま牛タンういたん…🪽♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "東北地方に行くのはじめてです~うれしい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "8月29日、30日の香川公演では生配信が決定しました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "会場でも配信でも盛り上がりましょうね♩"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今週もみんなのこと応援してるねー！\nちょっと涼しくなってきたようななってないような気がするよね…？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏は少し苦手だけど、\n今年の夏はとっってもたのしいです！☀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Buddiesのみなさんもそうだといいな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}], "source": "official"}